            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Until the start of your next turn:
• This unit has a Move characteristic of 4D6&quot;.
• While this unit is within 1&quot; of a terrain feature, the Attacks characteristic of its **Hurled Boulder** is D6 instead of 1.</characteristic>
