          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick another visible friendly **^^Big^^** or **^^Little^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is contesting its **loot hoard**, apply the effect below. Otherwise, make a rampage roll of D6. On a 3+, apply the effect below.

Add 1 to charge rolls for the target for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
