          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Shooting Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, the Damage characteristic of this unit&apos;s **Throwin&apos; Rocks** is 3 instead of D3.
Then, you can spend up to 3 rage dice. If you do:
• For each rage dice spent, add 2 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit&apos;s **Throwin&apos; Rocks** for the rest of the turn.
• If your opponent&apos;s **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
